<!-- FAQ Section -->
<section class="py-32 lg:py-48 px-8 bg-surface-container-low">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-16 max-w-2xl">
      <p class="font-label text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs mb-6 font-bold">
        Before You Sign Up
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-headline font-black tracking-tight">
        Questions you probably have.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-24 gap-y-12 max-w-5xl">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-headline font-black text-xl mb-3">Do I have to switch my POS system?</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          No. Chitline handles online ordering, your kitchen queue, and your menu — it works alongside whatever POS you already use. You don't have to rip anything out.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-headline font-black text-xl mb-3">Can I still use Uber Eats or DoorDash?</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Yes. Chitline is your direct ordering channel — the one that costs you nothing per order. You can keep third-party apps running if you want, but most shops find they shift more orders to direct over time once customers realize it's just as easy.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-headline font-black text-xl mb-3">What does "no commission" actually mean?</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          When a customer orders through your Chitline link, 100% of the order value goes to you. We charge a flat monthly fee and that's it. No percentage taken per order, no surprise fees at the end of the month.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-headline font-black text-xl mb-3">How do customers actually place an order?</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          You get a link you can put anywhere — your website, Instagram bio, a table tent, a sticker on the register. Customers tap it, your menu opens in their browser, they order. No app download required.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-headline font-black text-xl mb-3">How long does setup take?</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Most shops are live in under an hour. If you already have your menu in a PDF or on another site, our Menu Import Concierge ($100, one-time) will build the whole thing for you — typically done in minutes. Otherwise, The Studio lets you add items yourself in minutes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-headline font-black text-xl mb-3">What happens after the free trial?</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          After 14 days you choose a plan — Starter at $79/mo or Pro at $149/mo. No automatic charges during the trial. No card required to start. Cancel anytime.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Final CTA Section -->
<section class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-8 mb-48">
  <div class="bg-on-surface rounded-[2rem] md:rounded-[3rem] p-8 sm:p-16 md:p-32 text-center relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-white/20 via-transparent to-transparent">
      </div>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-white text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-8xl font-headline font-black mb-8 relative z-10 tracking-tight leading-tight md:leading-none">
      Stop paying commissions on your own customers.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-white/60 font-body text-xl md:text-2xl max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 relative z-10 leading-relaxed">
      Every order you take through Slice or DoorDash costs you 5–15%. On $15,000 a month in delivery sales, that's up to $2,250 walking out the door. Chitline is a flat $79/month. Your customers order direct. You keep the rest.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 justify-center relative z-10">
      <a
        href="/register"
        class="bg-primary text-white px-12 py-6 rounded-xl font-body font-black text-xl hover:bg-primary-container transition-all shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        Start your free 14-day trial
      </a>
      <a
        href="#instruments"
        class="border-2 border-white/20 text-white px-12 py-6 rounded-xl font-body font-black text-xl hover:bg-white/5 transition-all"
      >
        See the tools
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

